				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<figure class="fsImage"><picture><img alt="" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_6/v1769108604/ltschoolsorg/r5ebwelngqsncj2lzrx2/BoardofEducation.jpg%22,%22width%22:2200}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="BoardofEducation.jpg" data-resource-uuid="45a52860-715f-4624-a93f-563f7577c868" loading="lazy" role="presentation" src="" /></picture></figure>

<h1>MSDLT Board of Education</h1>

<p>MSD of Lawrence Township Board of Education meetings are open to the public. All MSDLT Work Sessions and Board Meetings are held at the Lawrence Education and Community Center, 5720 Wheeler Road. Below you&#39;ll find all the board members, their bio and contact information. Be sure to view the links on the right side of the page.<br />
<br />
For more information, please contact&nbsp;<a href="mailto:sheilablankenship@msdlt.org">Sheila Blankenship</a>.<br />
<br />
<a href="mailto:crystalpuckett@msdlt.k12.in.us, amynorman@msdlt.k12.in.us, jessicadunn@msdlt.k12.in.us, martalawrence@msdlt.k12.in.us, shawnsmith@msdlt.k12.in.us, sheilablankenship@msdlt.k12.in.us" target="_blank">Click here to email the entire Board of Education.</a></p>


